OL,3,GNEWSAColony of 40 feral cats found by
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn animal charity has spent almost
OL,7,F#3,600 safely trapping and neutering a
OL,8,F40-strong colony of feral cats found
OL,9,Fclose to a village.
OL,11,FCats Protection said residents raised
OL,12,Fthe alarm about the welfare of a
OL,13,Fgrowing clowder of feral cats near
OL,14,FLoddon in Norfolk in July.
OL,16,FThe charity said colonies of stray and
OL,17,Fabandoned cats were becoming more
OL,18,Fcommon, however, this was the largest
OL,19,Fgroup the Norwich branch had ever
OL,20,Fexperienced.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
