OL,3,GNEWSAColony of 40 feral cats found by
OL,4,Acharity
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnna Page, community fundraising
OL,7,Fofficer at Cats Protection, said: "This
OL,8,Fis the biggest colony of cats our team
OL,9,Fhas been called on to support. The
OL,10,Fcondition of some of the cats was a
OL,11,Fconcern and we needed to act fast to
OL,12,Fget treatment and help improve their
OL,13,Fwelfare."
